[116.795978, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 3: LSASS Credential Dumping (T1003.001)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Description**: Attacker dumped LSASS memory to extract domain credentials.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Artifact**: `/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp` (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Recovered Artifact**: Credential cache fragment in `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak` (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Alert ID**: `ALERT-02` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Status**: Alerted.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 4: Data Encrypted for Impact (T1486)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Description**: Attacker executed ransomware payload to encrypt host user data files.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Artifact**: `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe` (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Alert ID**: `ALERT-03` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Status**: Alerted.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 5: WMI Event Subscription Persistence (T1546.003)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Description**: Attacker established WMI persistence using an `__EventFilter` bound to a `CommandLineEventConsumer` in the WMI repository.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Artifact**: `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA` (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Status**: **SILENT (Unalerted)**.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
