[129.156929, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **CVE Identifier**: CVE-2017-0144 (`/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Severity**: CVSS 8.8 HIGH (v3.1) (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Target Service / Component**: Microsoft Windows SMBv1 Server (`srv.sys`) located at `/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys` (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Exploit Methodology**: Remote code execution via buffer handling vulnerability in SMBv1 request processing.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Observed Post-Exploitation Implant**: DoublePulsar-class SMB exploit implant dropped at `/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe` (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`, `/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## 3. Discrepancy & Verification Notes\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
