[176.00714, "o", "- **Action 2.3**: Quarantine ransomware executable `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.00734, "o", "  - *Target*: `/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe` (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`, `/sas/alerts.json` [ALERT-03])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.007412, "o", "  - *Verification*: Confirm binary removed from `/Users/Public` and cataloged in quarantine inventory.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[176.007441, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.007888, "o", "- **Action 2.4**: Neutralize silent WMI persistence in `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - *Target*: `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA` (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[176.007954, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.008236, "o", "  - *Command*: Execute `Get-CimInstance -Namespace root\\subscription -ClassName __EventFilter | Remove-CimInstance` and `Get-CimInstance -Namespace root\\subscription -ClassName CommandLineEventConsumer | Remove-CimInstance` via PowerShell.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.008396, "o", "  - *Verification*: `Get-CimInstance -Namespace root\\subscription` returns no suspicious consumers or filters.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[176.008542, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.008584, "o", "- **Action 2.5**: Quarantine hijacked DLL `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.008838, "o", "  - *Target*: `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll` (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.009031, "o", "  - *Verification*: Verify file moved to quarantine; replace with authentic Microsoft signed DLL if required by system.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Vulnerability Patching & System Hardening\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.009248, "o", "- **Action 3.1**: Disable legacy SMBv1 protocol system-wide.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.009414, "o", "  - *Target*: `/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys` (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`, `/sas/baseline.json` [CHK-07])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.009597, "o", "  - *Command*: PowerShell `Disable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName SMB1Protocol -NoRestart` / Registry `Set-ItemProperty -Path \"HKLM:\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\LanmanServer\\Parameters\" SMB1 -Type DWORD 0 -Force`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.009729, "o", "  - *Verification*: PowerShell `Get-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName SMB1Protocol` shows State: Disabled.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.009918, "o", "- **Action 3.2**: Apply Security Update MS17-010 (CVE-2017-0144 patching).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - *Target*: Operating system kernel / SMB drivers (`/sas/vulns.json`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[176.011213, "o", "  - *Verification*: Windows Update status check confirms MS17-010 / KB4012212 (or cumulative equivalent) installation.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 4: Credential Invalidation & Identity Recovery\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Action 4.1**: Reset credentials for Administrator and all domain accounts with active sessions on host `smb-prod-01`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - *Target*: Administrator and domain accounts (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`, `/sas/alerts.json` [ALERT-02])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - *Verification*: Confirm Active Directory password last set timestamp updated; invalidate Kerberos TGT/TGS tickets.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 5: Anti-Forensics Remediation & Logging Restoration\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Action 5.1**: Restore Windows Security/System Event Log service and enforce centralized log shipping.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - *Target*: System event logging framework (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - *Verification*: Confirm Event Log service active and forwarding Event ID 1102 / 4624 / 4688 to SIEM.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
