[181.500439, "o", "cat /app/progress.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[181.502164, "o", "# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\r\n\r\n## Timeline of Investigation\r\n- **2026-08-11 03:20 UTC**: Incident intake logged for target `smb-prod-01` (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`). High-severity EDR alert cluster received.\r\n- **Initial Alert Review**: Inspected `/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`. Observed alerts for exploit implant (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`), LSASS dump (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`), ransomware (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`), and SMBv1 baseline (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`).\r\n- **Disk Artifact Analysis**: Conducted forensic evaluation of read-only image `/disk`. Discovered silent persistence mechanisms and anti-forensic activity omitted from SAS alerts:\r\n  - Silent WMI event subscription (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`).\r\n  - Silent DLL search-order hijacking via `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`.\r\n  - Anti-forensic System log clearing recorded in `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx` (EventID 1102).\r\n  - C2 beacon IP `198.51.100.218` and domain `update-smb.example.cn` recovered from `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`.\r\n- **Ticket Reconciliation**: Reconciled change ticket `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` against on-disk and CTI evidence.\r\n- **Deliverable Generation**: Produced forensic reports, baseline analysis, vulnerability assessment, and remediation plan under `/app`.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n- [x] Analyze alert and vulnerability feeds (`/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`)\r\n- [x] Review CTI Advisory & ATT&CK Mapping (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`, `/sas/cti/advisory.pdf`)\r\n- [x] Inspect `/disk` filesystem and evidence artifacts\r\n- [x] Identify entry vector & exploit implant (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`)\r\n- [x] Identify credential dumping artifact (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`)\r\n- [x] Identify ransomware payload (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`)\r\n- [x] Uncover silent persistence mechanism 1: WMI Event Subscription (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`)\r\n- [x] Uncover silent persistence mechanism 2: DLL Hijacking (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`)\r\n- [x] Uncover silent defense evasion: Event Log Clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`)\r\n- [x] Reconcile change ticket against evidence (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`)\r\n- [x] Compile all 5 required reports in `/app` with backtick citations\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@ca5d1b5317d6:/app# "]
[194.496979, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/findings.json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-01\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1210\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-02\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1003.001\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-03\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/Public/enc.exe\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1486\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-04\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1546.003\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-05\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1574.001\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-06\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1070.001\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"chk\": \"CHK-07\",\n      \"path\": \"/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys\",\n      \"attck\": \"T1210\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": \"`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n"]
